I'll take care of them.

472
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:33,440
I don't understand your question.

473
00:30:39,576 --> 00:30:44,970
On 12 November, at 12.06 p.m., a penalty notice was issued for an illegal event and an order to dismantle the installation by 12 noon.

474
00:30:45,309 --> 00:30:51,274
And then a second penalty was issued for allegedly disobeying a request to dismantle by 12 noon.

475
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,788
The Vilnius City District Court found that Eglė Grėbliauskaitė did not intend to organise the event without a permit, acted in good faith, and was misled by the employees of the Vilnius City Municipality administration itself.

476
00:31:09,930 --> 00:31:12,424
The administrative proceedings were terminated due to the absence of the constituent elements of an administrative offence in the artist's actions.

477
00:31:14,469 --> 00:31:18,000
The second penalty was lifted by the municipality itself.

